<title>USA: Wilson ESD 7, Ariz., won by Zions.</title>
<headline>Wilson ESD 7, Ariz., won by Zions.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions First National Bank said it won $1.125 million of Wilson ESD 7, Ariz., school improvement bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.38 percent.</p>
</text>
